 ons to level up) to yin practice ending in savasana. Join our community an
 d meet other like-minded people! Yoga heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature
 ™.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow to yin yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\
 , outdoors near upper parking area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LO
