SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, THANKSGIVING DAY FLOW\, ALL LEVELS YOGA\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Join Yoga In Nature™ for the annua
 l "Gratitude" Thanksgiving morning yoga event!!!**\n**ALL LEVELS\, includi
 ng first timers\, welcome**. ***NOTE: SHOULD WE GET RAIN FOR THIS MORNING 
 11/26 AND CLASS BE CANCELED\, IT WILL BE RESCHEDULED FOR SATURDAY\, 11/28 
 AT 9:30AM AT THIS SAME LOCATION. I WILL POST SEPARATELY FOR SIGNUPS\, IF N
 EEDED:)***\nJoin us on Thanksgiving morning for a vinyasa flow to yin prac
 tice ending in savasana as we explore "gratitude" the theme this month. Fe
 el free to stay for hot tea and community gathering following class. **Bri
 ng a friend or family member and let them enjoy the experience of yoga out
 doors\, in nature:)**\nPractice vinyasa flow yoga at North Carolina Museum
  of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS 
 GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YO
 U COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE 
 RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the grass Ellipse area:)
  **$15/person. NOTE: if you have 4+ people in your group\, message me for 
 special family pricing.**\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander\nPaypal dgenander
 @yogainnature.com\naccepting Zelle\n\nCome flow with us! Bring a mat\, tow
 el or plastic liner to protect your mat if ground is damp\, water\, and an
 ything the you use for your practice. Recommend wearing layers as we get i
 nto the cooler months. We will begin in a seated meditation\, then vinyasa
  flow practice to yin\, ending in savasana. Meet others\, make friends in 
 our yoga community.
