SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™ at O'Kelly Chapel at For Garden's Sake
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nGrateful to be back at For Garden's Sa
 ke\, this time indoors at the O'Kelly Chapel (located on the grounds of th
 e garden center) for a **holiday inspired "Joy" slow vinyasa flow to yin p
 ractice. Beginners and those new to yoga\, WELCOME. *NOTE: payment due at 
 signup.***\nWe will connect with our breath for this 60 minute yoga class 
 followed by hot season tea\, hot chocolate\, and light snack. Coupon offer
  provided from FGS for your shopping joy in their garden center/store.\nPl
 ease bring your yoga mat\, (block and blanket if needed for your comfort)\
 , water bottle\, insulated mug for hot tea/cocoa (or I will have cups).\nL
 imited to 14 people for this intimate space indoors.\nPlease pay at signup
  to hold your spot. Your payment is your ticket to the event.\nVenmo @Darl
 ene-Genander (0862 if asked)\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nOR Zelle
