SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS\, Lake Crabtree Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Note the time for cooler months will
  be 10am - 11am for our yoga practice.** Come enjoy nature in this cooler 
 weather\, as we do an **ALL LEVELS** vinyasa flow to yin yoga practice\, a
 t this beautiful location\, facing the lake. Modifications provided. Begin
 ners welcome.\n\nBRING YOUR OWN YOGA MAT\, towel\, water bottle\, and bloc
 k (if you use one). You may also want to bring an old towel or liner for u
 nder your mat\, if the ground is wet. Wearing layers recommended\, as it c
 ould start off cooler and warm in the sun within the hour of practice. We 
 will meet in the open field area near the parking lot. $15/person Acceptin
 g Venmo @Darlene-Genander or PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com or cash\n\n
 Lake Crabtree County Park\, past the entrance booth\, at the open field\, 
 near volleyball courts and Old Beech Nature Trail... first right after you
  enter the park.(If you get to the entrance where there are boat rentals a
 nd launch area you've gone too far).\nLake Crabtree County Park\, 1400 Avi
 ation Parkway\, Morrisville
